WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:40.931
A simple request can require an unfamiliar sequence

00:00:40.931 --> 00:01:19.712
A task probe is different from a product league table

00:01:19.712 --> 00:01:45.419
The path taken does not reveal the available menu

00:01:45.419 --> 00:02:19.230
An exposed service still has a defined boundary

00:02:19.230 --> 00:02:56.815
Earlier results can steer every later round

00:02:56.815 --> 00:03:33.564
An alternative action can admit new candidates

00:03:33.564 --> 00:04:03.401
Stopping is a decision about unseen evidence

00:04:03.401 --> 00:04:39.533
Record actions, observations, options and stopping
